[00:00.00] 作词 : Sam Westhoff/Collins Obinna Chibueze/Myles Smith/Barrett Conner
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Sam Westhoff/Collins Obinna Chibueze/Myles Smith/Barrett Conner
[00:04.50]Living on the edge and finding out it's kinda dull
[00:04.50]原以为刀尖起舞多么刺激
[00:08.57]Realize I am somebody that I don't know at all
[00:08.57]却发现这种生活索然无味
[00:12.92]Oh God, would you tell me why I'm worn down to the bone?
[00:12.92]天啊 能否告诉我为何身心俱疲？
[00:17.23]Even though I've only seen half of the world, I'm coming home
[00:17.23]虽未看遍世间风景 我却已想归去
[00:22.07]Hanging on to hope, I'm losing grip of time and space
[00:22.07]紧攥着希望 却在时空中迷失方向
[00:26.28]Mind is running circles over something I can't change
[00:26.28]为无法改变的事 思绪打转如陀螺
[00:30.38]I've loved, I've tried, no one told me when in Rome
[00:30.38]我曾爱过 尝试过 却无人告诉我入乡随俗
[00:34.65]Am I feeling all the feelings or am I just going numb?
[00:34.65]此刻是百感交集 还是早已麻木？
[00:40.03]Oh me, oh my, would you look in my eyes?
[00:40.03]噢 看看我的眼睛吧
[00:44.40]We laugh or cry just to feel alive
[00:44.40]我们哭笑不过为感受活着
[00:48.26]Oh-oh-oh, oh-oh-oh
[00:50.64]No time for living a lie
[00:50.64]没时间继续自欺欺人
[00:52.61]Oh-oh-oh, oh-oh-oh
[00:55.00]Time flies, so don't blink twice
[00:55.00]光阴似箭 可别眨眼错过
